SUMMARY:NatureFest
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a FREE\, family-friendly celebration of nature in North Carolina! Explore the wonders of nature—from plant powers to live animals to fairy house building—through fun\, hands-on activity stations setup throughout the Garden. Designed for families with children up to age 10\, this outdoor event is a great way to connect with nature and enjoy a day of learning and discovery together. \nNo registration required. More event details coming soon!
